// M5-A3P-1010. Ch20 U05 layer 5, Nhoa (Pell), the arrival. act3_ch20.md §2 U05; vowbound §5.
// Memory: a Lit Age gallery like the Vey's, lamps steady, silt-light falling (NO ICE or frost in the staging or words:
// ADR 0015; the cold is the deep's). Nhoa: Ressa, Pell's clutch-sister, the only Kirru Cantor. He fights her silently.
// If ch15_pell_said_he_knew, before the fight, his line (act2_ch15 flag table).
title: ch20_nhoa
location: ch20/undertow_layers
---
@letterbox on
@camera U19
@music memory_lowlight fade=3.0
@vfx glimmer_held at=gallery_silt count=60 rate=slow
@wait 5.0
@camera U20
@anim nhoa turn_to pell
@wait 3.0
<<if $ch15_pell_said_he_knew>>
    Pell [neutral]: I knew about him too. I did not say. I am learning when to say. #line:ch20_nhoa_001
    @wait 2.0
<<endif>>
@letterbox off
<<event start_battle ch20_nhoa>>
===
